          "settings": {
            "question": "What size BMX do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>More information on choosing the correct BMX size can be found on our <a href=\"/pages/bmx-bike-size-guide\" title=\"BMX size guide\">BMX size guide</a>.</p>"
