          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get in touch, and when are you open?",
            "answer": "<p>You can email UNTOLD BMX at <a href=\"mailto:support@untoldbmx.co.uk\">support@untoldbmx.co.uk</a>, and we reply within 24 hours. You can also use the live chat or the <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact us\">contact page</a>.</p><p>Support hours are Monday to Friday 9am–5pm and Saturday 9am–3pm, and the shop is closed on Sunday.</p>"
